      "text": "* Performance\n* Availability\n* Reliability\n* Scalability\n* Consistency: The system must\nmaintain data consistency and prevent\nduplicate or conflicting applications.\n* Security and Privacy\n* Usability\n* Observability\n* Maintainability",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Performance\n* Availability\n* Reliability\n* Scalability\n* Consistency: The system must maintain data consistency and prevent duplicate or conflicting applications.\n* Security and Privacy\n* Usability\n* Observability\n* Maintainability",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
